       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "10852829"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Potential role in vesicular protein trafficking, mainly in the early secretory pathway. Contributes to the coupled localization of TMED2 and TMED10 in the cis-Golgi network"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Monomer in endoplasmic reticulum, endoplasmic reticulum-Golgi intermediate compartment and cis-Golgi network. Interacts (via C-terminus) with COPG1; the interaction involves dimeric TMED3; however, there are conflicting reports on the interaction. Interacts with GORASP1 and GORASP2 (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
